{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_106_chief-title\">CHIEF</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">CHIEF 明确串联 CTransPath tile 自监督和带解剖条件的 WSI attention 弱监督，而非只发布局部 patch encoder。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Couples self-supervised tile encoding (CTransPath) with anatomical-site-conditioned whole-slide attention aggregation trained across 60,530 WSIs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">H&amp;E WSI、tile 特征及训练时的癌症/解剖部位弱标签</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">H&amp;E whole-slide image tiles + anatomical primary site text/categorical embedding</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">通用 tile embedding、WSI embedding 和诊断/预后任务输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Slide-level diagnostic representation for cancer detection, tumor origin, genomic mutation, and survival prediction</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(a) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-07894-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_106_chief')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_106_chief')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"CHIEF original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(a)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/ae286e936572fc945474.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(a) · PDF p.Official full-size Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_106_chief\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_106_chief')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_106_chief\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Whole-slide image</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Whole-slide image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">多中心、多癌种 WSI 输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests h&amp;e whole-slide image tiles + anatomical primary site text/categorical embedding and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-slide image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"多中心、多癌种 WSI 输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests h&amp;e whole-slide image tiles + anatomical primary site text/categorical embedding and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-slide image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Whole-slide image\" data-node-name-en=\"Whole-slide image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Whole-slide image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多中心、多癌种 WSI 输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests h&amp;e whole-slide image tiles + anatomical primary site text/categorical embedding and prepares initial tensor representations (Whole-slide image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从组织区域采样局部 patch\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes WSI tile sequence to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"WSI tile 序列\" data-node-name-en=\"WSI tile sequence\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">WSI tile 序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">WSI tile sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从组织区域采样局部 patch</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes WSI tile sequence to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"自监督 Swin Transformer tile encoder，输出 768 维局部特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CHIEF-CTransPath within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"CHIEF-CTransPath\" data-node-name-en=\"CHIEF-CTransPath\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CHIEF-CTransPath</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">自监督 Swin Transformer tile encoder，输出 768 维局部特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CHIEF-CTransPath within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"向 WSI 模型提供组织来源上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs token within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"解剖部位 token/监督\" data-node-name-en=\"token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">解剖部位 token/监督</span><span class=\"lang-en\">token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">向 WSI 模型提供组织来源上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs token within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对可变数量 tile 加权汇聚并识别关键实例\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Attention WSI aggregator within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Attention WSI aggregator\" data-node-name-en=\"Attention WSI aggregator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Attention WSI aggregator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对可变数量 tile 加权汇聚并识别关键实例</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Attention WSI aggregator within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用 slide-level 癌症相关标签训练全片模式识别\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs WSI weakly supervised pretraining within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"WSI 弱监督预训练\" data-node-name-en=\"WSI weakly supervised pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">WSI 弱监督预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">WSI weakly supervised pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用 slide-level 癌症相关标签训练全片模式识别</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs WSI weakly supervised pretraining within the core two stage tile and site wsi foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可冻结迁移的 768 维全片表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies CHIEF WSI embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"CHIEF WSI embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"CHIEF WSI embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CHIEF WSI embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可冻结迁移的 768 维全片表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies CHIEF WSI embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"肿瘤来源、biomarker 与预后模型\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces slide-level diagnostic representation for cancer detection, tumor origin, genomic mutation, and survival prediction via heads.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"诊断/分子/生存 heads\" data-node-name-en=\"heads\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_106_chief', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">诊断/分子/生存 heads</span><span class=\"lang-en\">heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">肿瘤来源、biomarker 与预后模型</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces slide-level diagnostic representation for cancer detection, tumor origin, genomic mutation, and survival prediction via heads.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"CHIEF Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CHIEF 的注意力式全切片聚合与判读</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Anatomical-Site-Conditioned Attention MIL Whole-Slide Aggregation &amp; Contrastive Supervision</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"CHIEF：核心公式 · CHIEF 的注意力式全切片聚合与判读\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"106\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.770381pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.71297 -69.083544 288.391386 25.770381\" width=\"288.391386pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.16