tomical site context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">联合自监督图像预训练与弱监督全切片聚合学习癌症表征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combine a pretrained hybrid CNN-Transformer tile encoder with a weakly supervised WSI attention aggregator conditioned on anatomical site.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在多中心多癌种 WSI 上学习可用于诊断和生存预测的通用表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Two-stage tile + slide pretraining across 19 anatomical sites with broad multi-center external validation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于癌种识别、分子标志物和预后风险建模</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Applied to cancer detection, tumor origin identification, genomic profile inference, and survival risk stratification.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">临床广度突出；回顾性关联不等同于前瞻性决策效益</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Demonstrates broad multi-center retrospective validation; prognostic risk scores still require prospective trial verification.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">先用无标签 tile 学局部组织形态，再用 slide 弱标签学全片模式。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">attention 聚合在大量实例中选择与病例标签相关的区域。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">解剖部位上下文与多中心预训练共同提升跨癌种复用。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Combine a pretrained hybrid CNN-Transformer tile encoder with a weakly supervised WSI attention aggregator conditioned on anatomical site.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Two-stage tile + slide pretraining across 19 anatomical sites with broad multi-center external validation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Anatomical-Site-Conditioned Attention MIL Whole-Slide Aggregation &amp; Contrastive Supervision.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一 WSI 表示可迁移到癌种识别、分子标志物和生存风险。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">弱监督注意力不是病理学因果定位，回顾性预后关联也不等同于治疗决策效益。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Applied to cancer detection, tumor origin identification, genomic profile inference, and survival risk stratification.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Demonstrates broad multi-center retrospective validation; prognostic risk scores still require prospective trial verification.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07894-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Pathology Foundation Model for Cancer Diagnosis and Prognosis Prediction</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hms-dbmi/CHIEF\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
